OL,3,GNEWSAScheme to reopen road after six
OL,4,Ayears to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme to reopen a key city road to
OL,7,Ftraffic after its six year-closure has
OL,8,Fbeen given the go ahead.
OL,10,FDryden Road, which runs alongside the
OL,11,FRoyal Devon and Exeter Hospital site,
OL,12,Fwas closed in 2020 to create better
OL,13,Fconditions for cyclists.
OL,15,FMembers of the Exeter Highways and
OL,16,FTraffic Orders Committee (HATOC) have
OL,17,Fnow backed designs to help reopen the
OL,18,Froad, which are set to cost nearly
OL,19,F#500,000 and include cycle lanes,
OL,20,Fpedestrian crossings, a 20mph speed
OL,21,Flimit and speed humps.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
