OL,3,GNEWSAScheme to reopen road after six
OL,4,Ayears to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Exeter Cycling Campaign, which
OL,7,Fobjects to cars and lorries being
OL,8,Fallowed back on to the road, said it
OL,9,Fwas preparing a legal challenge to the
OL,10,Fmove.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
